    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/bb18d29176ae5f4cbf4307d2f5c5bf47.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/bb18d29176ae5f4cbf4307d2f5c5bf47.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/bb18d29176ae5f4cbf4307d2f5c5bf47.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/3e982652ef2977fe935b30b2932394e1.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/3e982652ef2977fe935b30b2932394e1.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/3e982652ef2977fe935b30b2932394e1.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on the Ultimate Space Rogue-lite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-Astrophy</strong> offers a unique rogue-lite experience, where each run is a new opportunity to adapt, overcome challenges, and make key decisions. Join Polo, a brave cat abducted by a mysterious extraterrestrial force, as you explore vast star systems, face exotic planets, and fight to recover your lost memories\u2026 and discover who caused such a cat-astrophe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/ba84c4619e7f60a5d8714a74d5b1f9ec.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/ba84c4619e7f60a5d8714a74d5b1f9ec.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/ba84c4619e7f60a5d8714a74d5b1f9ec.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/4db3c94dfe6ed20b6e152d0e3b348576.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/4db3c94dfe6ed20b6e152d0e3b348576.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/4db3c94dfe6ed20b6e152d0e3b348576.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Exploration</strong>: Travel through unique worlds, each with its own mysteries and secrets. Follow the clues about Polo's past and forge your own destiny in a vast universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong>: Master a real-time combat system that combines strategy and skill. Use Polo's special abilities to defeat alien enemies and overcome challenges in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Cursor</strong>: Control a stellar cursor to attack enemies while managing Polo's abilities in fluid and strategic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reconfiguration System:</strong> Modify Polo's capabilities throughout the game with upgrades and strategic adaptations that transform your playstyle in each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability Customization</strong>: Adapt and enhance Polo's abilities to suit your playstyle and face different types of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades</strong>: Use star fragments to unlock abilities and upgrades that persist between sessions, helping you overcome increasingly difficult challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Death</strong>: Every decision counts, as death is permanent. If you fall in battle, you'll lose everything and must start over, testing your skills and choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Routes</strong>: Choose your own path in each playthrough, selecting the planets you wish to travel to. As you progress, you'll unlock new planets and routes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Catching Graphics</strong>: Enjoy stunning landscapes and alien creatures with a simple yet visually appealing style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storyline</strong>: Uncover the dark motives behind Polo's abduction as you explore a narrative full of emotion, mystery, and surprising twists. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging and Unique Rogue-lite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-Astrophy</strong> is the perfect combination of rogue-lite and rogue-like, with strategic combat, customizable routes, and a difficulty that challenges your wits in every run. Each game is a new opportunity to adapt, improve, and survive in an unforgiving universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for the ultimate rogue-like, with innovative mechanics, fair but challenging difficulty, and a vibrant aesthetic, <strong>Cat-Astrophy</strong> is the challenge you've been waiting for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2aa4d2edca176cbb6ffa4d7fc6cc2bd.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2aa4d2edca176cbb6ffa4d7fc6cc2bd.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2aa4d2edca176cbb6ffa4d7fc6cc2bd.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/b1f1a2c234deda06b5062ecef20b3b6a.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/b1f1a2c234deda06b5062ecef20b3b6a.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/b1f1a2c234deda06b5062ecef20b3b6a.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2719552658481300891402a04992f98.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2719552658481300891402a04992f98.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e2719552658481300891402a04992f98.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
