ns that transform your playstyle in each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability Customization</strong>: Adapt and enhance Polo's abilities to suit your playstyle and face different types of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades</strong>: Use star fragments to unlock abilities and upgrades that persist between sessions, helping you overcome increasingly difficult challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Death</strong>: Every decision counts, as death is permanent. If you fall in battle, you'll lose everything and must start over, testing your skills and choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Routes</strong>: Choose your own path in each playthrough, selecting the planets you wish to travel to. As you progress, you'll unlock new planets and routes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Catching Graphics</strong>: Enjoy stunning landscapes and alien creatures with a simple yet visually appealing style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storyline</strong>: Uncover the dark motives behind Polo's abduction as you explore a narrative full of emotion, mystery, and surprising twists. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.poster.avif?t=1753266638\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.webm?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/d9bdc325c8eb21b3d18bfb33149f799a.mp4?t=1753266638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging and Unique Rogue-lite</strong></p>